        "TileImage": "$($repository b2cdf231-2bd5-40bb-aa22-789884c16cae).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rOur client toady is a member of Don Yates&apos; security detail, who has been at the forefront of a potential scandal involving Valentina Yates, and 4 fellow guards. our client requests that you elimate all of them, as he fears word will spread. This looks to be quite the potential disaster for our client, should you be compromised, or if his involvement is made public. it is up to you to deal with this one.\r\rgood luck, agent.\rDiana.",
